    "## 5 · Verification - 3-century centred Theil-Sen slopes",
    "",
    "For each century c, fit Theil-Sen on the 3-anchor window [c-100, c, c+100] BCE and report slope = dZ/d(BCE). **Forward-time direction** (BCE decreases as time moves forward):",
    "",
    "* *form declines in forward-time* <-> slope(dZ_form/dBCE) > 0  ",
    "* *decoration rises in forward-time* <-> slope(dZ_dec/dBCE) < 0  ",
    "",
    "Pass condition: `slope_form_3c > 0` AND `slope_dec_3c < 0`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": 6,
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "rows = []\n",
    "BCE_arr = sub['BCE'].values\n",
    "for i in range(1, len(sub)-1):\n",
    "    xw = BCE_arr[i-1:i+2].astype(float)\n",
    "    sf, _, _, _ = theilslopes(sub['PotteryForm'].values[i-1:i+2],    xw)\n",
    "    sd, _, _, _ = theilslopes(sub['PotteryDecoration'].values[i-1:i+2], xw)\n",
    "    rows.append({\n",
    "        'BCE': int(BCE_arr[i]),\n",
    "        'slope_form_3c (dZ/dBCE)': sf,\n",
    "        'slope_dec_3c (dZ/dBCE)' : sd,\n",
    "        'FORWARD_pass (Form down, Dec up)': (sf > 0) and (sd < 0),\n",
    "    })\n",
    "ts_df = pd.DataFrame(rows)\n",
    "print(ts_df.to_string(index=False, formatters={\n",
    "    'slope_form_3c (dZ/dBCE)': '{:.5f}'.format,\n",
    "    'slope_dec_3c (dZ/dBCE)' : '{:.5f}'.format,\n",
    "}))\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print('Centuries where BOTH forward-time slopes pass:')\n",
